# Window System Governance

**Contract:** `WINDOW-CONTRACT.md`

## Current State

Inertia **page-based** navigation. No centralized Window Manager yet.

## Rules

- Do NOT build independent drag/z-index/window stacks inside modules
- Use shared Dialog components for confirmations and short edits
- Assign stable logical IDs: `enrollment.details`, `student.edit`
- Large workflows → full page, not cramped dialog

## Target (when implemented)

Central Window Manager owns: open/close/minimize/maximize/move/resize/focus/persist.

## Dialog Adaptation

| Profile | Pattern |
|---------|---------|
| Desktop | Modal dialog |
| Tablet | Adaptive dialog |
| Mobile | Full-screen / bottom sheet |

## Windows Desktop

Dev baseline is Windows — plan for multiple concurrent forms/windows on desktop; mobile uses pages/stack.
